### Data Pipeline Workflow

PostgreSQL
    │
    ▼
Incremental Data Extraction
    │
    ▼
Data Cleaning & Transformation
       (Python + Pandas)
    │
    ▼
Load Data into Snowflake
    │
    ▼
Snowflake Data Warehouse

Apache Airflow → Schedules and orchestrates the ETL pipeline


How it works:

1. Extract: Retrieves new order records from PostgreSQL using an incremental loading condition.
2. Transform: Uses Python and Pandas to clean and prepare the extracted data.
3. Load: Loads the processed records into Snowflake for analytical use.
4. Orchestrate: Apache Airflow schedules the pipeline and manages task execution and retries.
